{"version":1,"content":"<p>巴西反對派候選人、前總統博索納羅之長子弗拉維奧在大選落敗後，違令離境，與家人抵達美國。</p><p>博索納羅抵美後宣稱自己才是巴西的「合法領袖」，又指他是巴西最高法院及勝選的總統盧拉策動「選舉政變」的受害者。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:20:45.102422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:43:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.604613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.503171+00:00","content_hash":"4ab781240285a2c18244f8dcbb9aa23483dd68d5ffd471a26362aac57d984d14","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}